    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a lucid nightmare in <strong>R.E.M. Rage</strong>, a rogue-like beat 'em up where fast reflexes, wild combos, and creative movement are your only way out. You are a lone fighter caught in a twisted dream world \u2014 each run throws you into new challenges, bizarre environments, and relentless enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain aerial attacks, master special moves (some oddly familiar...), and make use of parkour elements to control space and survive the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built in Unreal Engine 5, <i>R.E.M. Rage</i> blends arcade-style combat with modern rogue-like progression. No two runs are the same, and death is just the beginning of another fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch, jump, dodge, rage \u2014 wake up swinging.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a lucid nightmare in <strong>R.E.M. Rage</strong>, a rogue-like beat 'em up where fast reflexes, wild combos, and creative movement are your only way out. You are a lone fighter caught in a twisted dream world \u2014 each run throws you into new challenges, bizarre environments, and relentless enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain aerial attacks, master special moves (some oddly familiar...), and make use of parkour elements to control space and survive the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built in Unreal Engine 5, <i>R.E.M. Rage</i> blends arcade-style combat with modern rogue-like progression. No two runs are the same, and death is just the beginning of another fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch, jump, dodge, rage \u2014 wake up swinging.</p>",
    "short_description": "R.E.M. Rage is a fast-paced rogue-like beat 'em up with wild combos, flashy specials, and parkour-infused action. Play as a lone fighter trapped in a lucid nightmare and battle through surreal dreamscapes. One hero. Endless rage.",
